          "start": 1317
        },
        "quote": "(2) Provide appropriate catchlines, headings and titles for sections and other subdivisions of the code printed in the supplement, and make changes in such catchlines, headings and titles;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.060:block:4#text",
