          "start": 1506
        },
        "quote": "(3) Assign appropriate numbers to sections and other subdivisions to be inserted in the code and, where necessary to accommodate new material, change existing section or other subdivision numbers;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.060:block:5#text",
