          "start": 1703
        },
        "quote": "(4) Change the words “this ordinance” or words of the same meaning to “this title,” “this division,” “this chapter,” “this article,” etc., as the case may be, or to “TMC ________ to ________” (inserting section numbers to indicate the sections of the code which embody the substantive sections of the ordinance incorporated into the code); and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.060:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
