          "start": 2047
        },
        "quote": "(5) Make other nonsubstantive changes necessary to preserve the original meaning of ordinance sections inserted into the code; but in no case shall the codifier make any change in the meaning or effect of ordinance material included in the supplement or already embodied in the code. (Code 1981 § 1-4. Code 1995 § 1-6.)",
